        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/c37758/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-02-17T02:01:45.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Spiff\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/spiff/48/1865_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Spiff:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Is it true that the damage she does when a fowl card is destroyed changed also? &nbsp;My original card says (H)-2 psychic damage for that, but I think I heard that her new card says only (H)-1 now. &nbsp;True or false?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>It's H-2 on her front, 1 on her back, same as before.&nbsp; As far as I can tell, none of the cards have actually changed mechanically, they've just been reworded to be more clear.</p>",
